{"ordinal":9894,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454548168708","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_1_0db4696","source":"Daughter: Значит, скоро он придёт!","target":"Daughter: Atunci va veni curând!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9895,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454548168707","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_1_0d50884","source":"Daughter: А я была там! Он пошевелился, когда я убегала.","target":"Daughter: Dar eu eram acolo! S-a mișcat când fugeam.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9896,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454548168706","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_1_0eb83d1","source":"Daughter: Вы же не видели, что там было!","target":"Daughter: Nici n-ați văzut ce s-a întâmplat acolo!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9897,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454548168705","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_06917b3","source":"Возможно, папа не придёт за тобой. Я не знаю, что с ним","target":"E posibil ca tatăl tău să nu mai vină după tine. Nu știu ce s-a întâmplat cu el","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9898,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454548168704","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_07fcabd","source":"Я не знаю, что ты видела. Но, похоже, твой отец умер","target":"Nu știu ce ai văzut. Dar se pare că tatăl tău a murit","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9899,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454543974411","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_0feebe4","source":"Daughter: У вас в комнате я видела телевизор. Можно там мультики смотреть?","target":"Daughter: Am văzut un televizor în camera dumneavoastră. Pot să mă uit acolo la desene animate?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9900,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454543974410","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_3_0405ce8","source":"Daughter: Вы про что?","target":"Daughter: Ce vreți să spuneți?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
