{"ordinal":9902,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454543974408","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_daughter_3_0bc0a7b","source":"Ты должна принять, что случилось","target":"Trebuie să accepți ce s-a întâmplat","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9903,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454543974407","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_daughter_3_041af15","source":"Daughter: Я... Я хо-чу к ма-ме.","target":"Daughter: Eu... eu vreau la ma-ma.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":9904,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454543974406","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Daughter_Asking_2_4_0c35410","source":"Daughter: Я хоть и бежала, но видела его.","target":"Daughter: Chiar dacă fugeam, l-am văzut.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-254.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
